      "message": "DB845c devices in LKFT lab reported a 2 second boot time regression while running andriod15-6.6 kernel builds. @yongqin.liu@linaro.org bisected down the regression to upstream commit “clk: qcom: Park shared RCGs upon registration”.\n\nThis 3 patch series reverts “clk: qcom: Park shared RCGs upon registration” and follow-up fixes from android15-6.6.\n\nAs mentioned in the commit message, this is android-6.6 specific regression, and not reproducible on linux-6.6.y and upstream kernel versions.",
